      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D779E00100003110000FF01014F6059B38AAAFF0C6211770B52304E869019500B57CE5E027684000A00100002FF00000677F3982D992800100002FF0000006B63572851FA552E0032500B531677F3300200100002011401410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就是「顎之化石」和「鰭之化石」。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n但這2個化石我都太喜歡了，\n實在沒辦法挑一種買回來。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C31662F300C984E4E4B531677F3300D548C300C9C2D4E4B531677F3300D300200100001BE01000A4F4690190032500B531677F3621190FD592A559C6B614E86FF0C000A5BE657286C928FA66CD563114E007A2E8CB756DE4F86300200100002011401410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，讓我拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳一件事。\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫我去買下<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳看上眼的化石好嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C8B93621162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B34E004EF64E8B3002000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B621153BB8CB74E0B00100003110000FF01014F6059B3770B4E0A773C7684531677F3597D55CEFF1F00100002011401410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "從委託人余恆那裡\n收下了<U+E300>20000！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 1,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F9E59D48A174EBA4F59604690A388E1000A65364E0B4E86E30000320030003000300030FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
