      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎喲！在復原化石時，\n盒子要先騰出空間。這是重點喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
