      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝！<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫我買了\n<U+0010><U+0002>ĉ<U+0002>回來啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1DFF0100100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B62118CB74E86000A001000020109000256DE4F86554AFF0100100002011401410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，我這就來復原化石。\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳稍等一下喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
